---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Session
    lg1: Breaks NeverResubmitted
    lg2: Path to the NeverResubmitted bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 breaks
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: No session, input kept for a host, no tmux yet
  s3: No session, input kept for a host
  s4: No host, input answered, a message waiting
  s5: Creating, a message waiting
  s6: Created, location not yet recorded, a message waiting
  s7: Pane recorded, provider up with its source, not bound, a message waiting
  s8: Session up
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  s2 --> s3: tmux becomes usable
  s3 --> s4: a host is back: the kept message is queued to run again
  s4 --> s5: a message reserves a new execution
  s5 --> s6: the host creates it
  s6 --> s7: its pane is recorded
  s7 --> s8: the turn binds the execution
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 teal
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 teal
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 teal
  class s8 breaks
  class s8 bugPath
